{"id": "yj30CW74J7QK", "owner": "showcase", "title": "SYNAPSE — Reasoning infrastructure for autonomous systems", "createdAt": 1790349560042, "updatedAt": 1790349732167, "versions": [{"prompt": "Landing page for an AI startup \"SYNAPSE\" — giant headline, animated glowing orb made with CSS, feature grid, logos strip, pricing teaser, CTA. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>SYNAPSE — Reasoning infrastructure for autonomous systems</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,800;0,900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0b0905;\n    --bg-2:#110e07;\n    --green:#ff1439;\n    --blue:#d1ff5b;\n    --ink:#f3e9df;\n    --muted:#9a907d;\n    --line:rgba(255,20,57,.14);\n    --line-soft:rgba(209,255,91,.12);\n    --maxw:1440px;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\n  body{\n    background:var(--bg);\n    color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n    overflow-x:hidden;\n  }\n  /* ---------- global texture layers ---------- */\n  .tex{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:9}\n  .tex.grid{\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,20,57,.055) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(209,255,91,.045) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size:44px 44px;\n    mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 90% at 50% 20%, #000000 20%, transparent 85%);\n    -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 90% at 50% 20%, #000000 20%, transparent 85%);\n    z-index:0;\n  }\n  .tex.pixels{\n    background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,20,57,.10) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size:8px 8px;\n    opacity:.5;\n    z-index:0;\n  }\n  .tex.scan{\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px, rgba(0,0,0,.34) 2px 4px);\n    opacity:.5;\n    mix-blend-mode:multiply;\n  }\n  .tex.vig{\n    background:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 50% 45%, transparent 40%, rgba(6,5,2,.85) 100%);\n  }\n  .tex.flick{background:rgba(255,20,57,.02);animation:flick 6s steps(2) infinite}\n  @keyframes flick{0%,96%{opacity:0}97%{opacity:.5}98%{opacity:0}99%{opacity:.35}100%{opacity:0}}\n\n  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;position:relative;z-index:2}\n  @media(max-width:700px){.wrap{padding:0 20px}}\n\n  /* ---------- type ---------- */\n  .mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace}\n  .eyebrow{\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);\n  }\n  h1,h2,h3{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:.9;margin:0}\n  p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}\n\n  /* ---------- nav ---------- */\n  header{\n    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;\n    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);\n    background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,9,5,.92), rgba(11,9,5,.55));\n    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:70px}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}\n  .brand .mark{width:26px;height:26px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(255,20,57,.7))}\n  .brand b{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.24em;font-weight:800}\n  .navlinks{display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:center}\n  .navlinks a{\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;position:relative;padding:4px 0;\n    transition:color .25s;\n  }\n  .navlinks a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n  .navlinks a::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:1px;width:0;background:var(--green);\n    box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green);transition:width .3s}\n  .navlinks a:hover::after{width:100%}\n  @media(max-width:900px){.navlinks{display:none}}\n\n  .btn{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    text-decoration:none;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid var(--green);color:#100504;\n    background:var(--green);font-weight:700;\n    box-shadow:0 0 0 rgba(255,20,57,.6), 0 0 22px rgba(255,20,57,.35);\n    transition:box-shadow .3s, transform .2s, background .3s;\n    clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 9px) 0,100% 9px,100% 100%,9px 100%,0 calc(100% - 9px));\n  }\n  .btn:hover{box-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(255,20,57,.75);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .btn.ghost{\n    background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border-color:rgba(209,255,91,.45);\n    box-shadow:inset 0 0 22px rgba(209,255,91,.07);\n  }\n  .btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(209,255,91,.3), inset 0 0 26px rgba(209,255,91,.12)}\n  .btn.sm{padding:10px 18px;font-size:11px}\n\n  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */\n  .hero{\n    position:relative;min-height:calc(100vh - 70px);\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;\n    padding:60px 0 40px;overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:3;text-align:center}\n  .badge{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,20,57,.05);\n    padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:34px;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);\n  }\n  .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:blip 1.6s infinite}\n  @keyframes blip{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}\n\n  h1.giant{\n    font-size:clamp(64px, 15.5vw, 236px);\n    line-height:.82;\n    letter-spacing:-.05em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    margin:0;\n  }\n  .giant .l1{\n    display:block;color:#fff2ea;\n    text-shadow:0 0 42px rgba(255,20,57,.35), 0 0 90px rgba(255,20,57,.18);\n  }\n  .giant .l2{\n    display:block;\n    background:linear-gradient(96deg, var(--green) 0%, #ff9eb6 32%, var(--blue) 72%, #e7ff9a 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;\n    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 28px rgba(209,255,91,.35));\n  }\n  .giant .l2 em{font-style:normal;position:relative}\n  .hero-sub{\n    max-width:620px;margin:30px auto 0;font-size:17px;color:#b4a893;line-height:1.65;\n  }\n  .hero-sub b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n  .hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:38px}\n  .hero-meta{\n    margin-top:54px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:0;flex-wrap:wrap;\n    border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px;\n  }\n  .hero-meta div{padding:0 38px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .hero-meta div:last-child{border-right:0}\n  .hero-meta strong{display:block;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--green);\n    text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,20,57,.45)}\n  .hero-meta span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n  @media(max-width:700px){.hero-meta div{padding:10px 18px;border-right:0}}\n\n  /* ---------- ORB ---------- */\n  .orb-stage{\n    position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n    width:min(760px,96vw);aspect-ratio:1;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .orb{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%}\n  .orb.core{\n    inset:29%;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 36% 30%, #ffe4ea 0%, var(--green) 22%, #a63c10 52%, #331f04 78%, #141002 100%);\n    box-shadow:\n      0 0 60px rgba(255,20,57,.55),\n      0 0 160px rgba(255,20,57,.35),\n      0 0 300px rgba(209,255,91,.22),\n      inset -18px -22px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.65),\n      inset 12px 14px 40px rgba(255,160,180,.25);\n    animation:breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  .orb.core::after{\n    content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0 2px, transparent 2px 5px);\n    mix-blend-mode:overlay;opacity:.7;\n  }\n  .orb.halo{\n    inset:14%;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,20,57,.30) 0%, rgba(209,255,91,.14) 45%, transparent 70%);\n    filter:blur(26px);animation:breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite reverse;\n  }\n  .orb.bloom{\n    inset:-6%;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(209,255,91,.20) 0%, rgba(255,20,57,.10) 35%, transparent 65%);\n    filter:blur(50px);animation:breathe 11s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  .orb.swirl{\n    inset:22%;\n    background:conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg, rgba(255,20,57,.55) 40deg, transparent 110deg,\n      rgba(209,255,91,.5) 190deg, transparent 260deg, rgba(255,20,57,.35) 320deg, transparent 360deg);\n    filter:blur(22px);opacity:.75;animation:spin 16s linear infinite;\n  }\n  .ring{\n    position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,20,57,.22);\n    inset:16%;\n  }\n  .ring.r2{inset:6%;border-color:rgba(209,255,91,.18);border-style:dashed}\n  .ring.r3{inset:-2%;border-color:rgba(255,20,57,.10)}\n  .ring-spin{position:absolute;inset:4%;animation:spin 28s linear infinite}\n  .ring-spin.rev{animation:spin 44s linear infinite reverse;inset:-4%}\n  .ring-spin svg{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}\n  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\n  @keyframes breathe{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.96}50%{transform:scale(1.045);opacity:1}}\n\n  .orb-glyphs{position:absolute;inset:0;animation:spin 60s linear infinite}\n  .orb-glyphs span{\n    position:absolute;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;\n    color:rgba(209,255,91,.55);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- logos strip ---------- */\n  .strip{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,20,57,.035), rgba(209,255,91,.035));\n    position:relative;z-index:3;overflow:hidden}\n  .strip-head{\n    text-align:center;padding:26px 0 0;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);\n  }\n  .marquee{display:flex;overflow:hidden;padding:22px 0 30px;\n    mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000000 12%,#000000 88%,transparent);\n    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000000 12%,#000000 88%,transparent)}\n  .track{display:flex;gap:64px;align-items:center;padding-right:64px;animation:slide 34s linear infinite;flex-shrink:0}\n  @keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}\n  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;opacity:.62;transition:opacity .3s;white-space:nowrap}\n  .logo:hover{opacity:1}\n  .logo svg{flex:none}\n  .logo span{font-weight:800;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#e8ddcf}\n  .logo span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n\n  /* ---------- sections ---------- */\n  section{position:relative;z-index:2}\n  .sec-pad{padding:118px 0}\n  @media(max-width:700px){.sec-pad{padding:76px 0}}\n  .sec-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:40px;margin-bottom:56px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(34px,5.2vw,64px);text-transform:uppercase}\n  .sec-head h2 span{color:var(--blue)}\n  .sec-head p{max-width:400px;font-size:15px}\n  .rule{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),rgba(209,255,91,.5),transparent);margin-top:14px}\n\n  /* ---------- features ---------- */\n  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n  @media(max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}\n  @media(max-width:620px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .cell{\n    background:var(--bg);padding:38px 32px 42px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\n    transition:background .35s;min-height:280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  }\n  .cell::before{\n    content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255,20,57,.12), transparent 70%);\n  }\n  .cell:hover::before{opacity:1}\n  .cell:hover{background:var(--bg-2)}\n  .cell .num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .ico{width:40px;height:40px;margin-bottom:22px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,20,57,.55))}\n  .cell h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase}\n  .cell p{font-size:14.5px}\n  .cell .tag{\n    margin-top:auto;padding-top:22px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;\n    letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,20,57,.7)}\n\n  /* ---------- pricing ---------- */\n  .price-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\n  @media(max-width:900px){.price-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .plan{\n    border:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 30px 32px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(17,14,7,.9),rgba(11,9,5,.9));\n    position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n    clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 16px) 0,100% 16px,100% 100%,16px 100%,0 calc(100% - 16px));\n  }\n  .plan.feat{\n    border-color:rgba(255,20,57,.5);\n    box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,20,57,.12), 0 0 60px rgba(255,20,57,.14), inset 0 0 60px rgba(255,20,57,.05);\n  }\n  .plan .pname{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue)}\n  .plan.feat .pname{color:var(--green)}\n  .plan .pprice{font-size:52px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:18px 0 4px;line-height:1}\n  .plan .pprice sub{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);vertical-align:baseline;letter-spacing:0;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n  .plan .pdesc{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:24px;min-height:44px}\n  .plan ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\n  .plan li{display:flex;gap:11px;font-size:14px;color:#c6baa8;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.4}\n  .plan li svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}\n  .plan .btn{margin-top:auto;justify-content:center}\n  .ribbon{\n    position:absolute;top:0;right:0;background:var(--green);color:#150a03;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.22em;padding:6px 14px;font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .price-note{text-align:center;margin-top:34px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;\n    letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}\n\n  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */\n  .cta{\n    position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n    background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 120% at 50% 110%, rgba(255,20,57,.16), transparent 60%),\n               radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 90% at 20% 0%, rgba(209,255,91,.10), transparent 60%);\n    text-align:center;padding:120px 0 130px;\n  }\n  .cta h2{font-size:clamp(40px,8vw,104px);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.86}\n  .cta h2 span{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px var(--green);\n    text-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(255,20,57,.35)}\n  .cta p{max-width:520px;margin:26px auto 0;font-size:16px}\n  .cta .hero-cta{margin-top:36px}\n  .cta-line{\n    display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n  .cta-line i{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n\n  /* ---------- footer ---------- */\n  footer{padding:60px 0 44px}\n  .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}\n  .foot-cols{display:flex;gap:70px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .fcol h4{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--green);margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:500}\n  .fcol a{display:block;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px;transition:color .2s}\n  .fcol a:hover{color:var(--ink)}\n  .foot-bottom{margin-top:52px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);\n    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#6b6252;text-transform:uppercase}\n\n  /* reveal */\n  .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1), transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}\n  .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}\n    .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#c8ff00;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Archivo Black\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"startup\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/p5-js.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"trc-s\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/open-design.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>S</i>SYNAPSE</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Product</a><a href=\"#\">Research</a><a href=\"#\">Pricing</a><a href=\"#\">Careers</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Request access</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>AI startup · Robinhood Chain</span><h1><em>SYNAPSE</em></h1><p>Reasoning infrastructure for autonomous systems. Think bigger, ship faster.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Request access</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"trc-dots\"><i class=on></i><i></i><span>01 / 02</span></div>\n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"tex grid\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex pixels\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex scan\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex vig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex flick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M16 2 L28 9 V23 L16 30 L4 23 V9 Z\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ff1439\"/>\n        <path d=\"M16 2 V12 M16 20 V30 M4 9 L12 14 M28 9 L20 14 M4 23 L12 18 M28 23 L20 18\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <b>SYNAPSE</b>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"navlinks\">\n      <a href=\"#platform\">Platform</a>\n      <a href=\"#capabilities\">Capabilities</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#docs\">Docs</a>\n    </nav>\n    <a class=\"btn sm\" href=\"#cta\">Request access</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"top\">\n\n  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"orb-stage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"orb bloom\"></div>\n      <div class=\"orb halo\"></div>\n      <div class=\"orb swirl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"orb core\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring r3\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring r2\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring-spin\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"99\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,20,57,.30)\" stroke-width=\".6\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 9\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"199\" cy=\"100\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#ff1439\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"1\" cy=\"100\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#d1ff5b\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ring-spin rev\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"99\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(209,255,91,.22)\" stroke-width=\".6\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"1\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#d1ff5b\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"199\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ff1439\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"orb-glyphs\">\n        <span style=\"top:6%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)\">NODE·01</span>\n        <span style=\"top:50%;right:2%;transform:translateY(-50%)\">LATENCY 38MS</span>\n        <span style=\"bottom:5%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)\">CTX 2.4M</span>\n        <span style=\"top:50%;left:2%;transform:translateY(-50%)\">SYNC·OK</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-inner\">\n      <div class=\"badge\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> SYNAPSE CORE v4 — now in open beta</div>\n      <h1 class=\"giant\">\n        <span class=\"l1\">Think</span>\n        <span class=\"l2\"><em>Faster</em></span>\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">\n        SYNAPSE is the <b>reasoning layer</b> for autonomous systems — a distributed inference mesh\n        that plans, verifies and executes across your entire stack. Sub-40ms decisions, at any scale.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#cta\">Deploy the mesh →</a>\n        <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#platform\">Read the whitepaper</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n        <div><strong>38ms</strong><span>p95 decision latency</span></div>\n        <div><strong>2.4M</strong><span>token context window</span></div>\n        <div><strong>99.99%</strong><span>mesh uptime</span></div>\n        <div><strong>17B</strong><span>daily inferences</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ LOGOS ============ -->\n  <section class=\"strip\" aria-label=\"Trusted by\">\n    <div class=\"strip-head\">Running in production at</div>\n    <div class=\"marquee\">\n      <div class=\"track\" id=\"track1\">\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M10 1l8 4.5v9L10 19 2 14.5v-9z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg><span>HELIO<i>GRID</i></span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#d1ff5b\"/></svg><span>NOCTURN</span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M2 16L10 2l8 14z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg><span>APEX<i>LAB</i></span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path d=\"M3 10h14M10 3v14\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1\"/></svg><span>QUADRANT</span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M4 10a6 6 0 1112 0 6 6 0 01-12 0z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path d=\"M10 1v18\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/></svg><span>VECTOR<i>ONE</i></span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M3 15L8 5l4 7 5-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>KRYPTON</span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M10 2l7 8-7 8-7-8z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg><span>OBSIDIAN<i>AI</i></span></div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"10\" r=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"10\" r=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg><span>MERIDIAN</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"track2\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ FEATURES ============ -->\n  <section class=\"sec-pad\" id=\"capabilities\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head rv\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">[ 02 — CAPABILITIES ]</div>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Built for<br><span>machine-speed</span> decisions</h2>\n          <div class=\"rule\" style=\"width:220px\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <p>Six primitives. One runtime. Everything you need to move from prompt-and-pray to verifiable autonomous execution.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">01 / MESH</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M20 11.5L9 27M20 11.5L31 27M11 30h18\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n          <h3>Distributed inference mesh</h3>\n          <p>Route every request to the nearest warm shard. Automatic failover across 19 regions with zero cold-start penalty.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ 38ms p95 global</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">02 / VERIFY</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 4l14 6v10c0 8-6 14-14 16C12 34 6 28 6 20V10z\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M14 20l4.5 4.5L27 16\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n          <h3>Proof-carrying output</h3>\n          <p>Every answer ships with a signed reasoning trace. Replay any decision, audit any hop, satisfy any regulator.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ SOC 2 · ISO 27001</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">03 / PLAN</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"7\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"23\" y=\"7\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"25\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M11 16v5h18v-5M20 21v4\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n          <h3>Recursive task graphs</h3>\n          <p>Agents decompose goals into typed sub-tasks, then re-plan on failure. Branch, merge and roll back like git.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ 240 steps deep</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">04 / MEMORY</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M7 10v10c0 2.8 5.8 5 13 5s13-2.2 13-5V10\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M7 20v10c0 2.8 5.8 5 13 5s13-2.2 13-5V20\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></svg>\n          <h3>Persistent world model</h3>\n          <p>A 2.4M-token working context backed by vector + symbolic store. Your agents remember last quarter, not last turn.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ 2.4M tokens live</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">05 / GUARD</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"17\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M13 17v-5a7 7 0 0114 0v5\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"25\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#ff1439\"/></svg>\n          <h3>Policy at the edge</h3>\n          <p>Declarative guardrails compiled into the runtime. Block, redact or escalate before a single token leaves the mesh.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ 0 data egress by default</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"cell rv\">\n          <div class=\"num\">06 / SHIP</div>\n          <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 26L20 5l14 21\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M6 26h28M13 33h14\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#ff1439\"/></svg>\n          <h3>One-line deployment</h3>\n          <p>Drop-in SDKs for TypeScript, Python, Rust and Go. Self-host on your own metal or run fully managed.</p>\n          <div class=\"tag\">→ npm i @synapse/core</div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ PLATFORM SNIPPET ============ -->\n  <section class=\"sec-pad\" id=\"platform\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"rv\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,20,57,.05),rgba(209,255,91,.04));padding:0;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr\" class=\"split\">\n          <div style=\"padding:46px 42px\">\n            <div class=\"eyebrow\">[ 03 — RUNTIME ]</div>\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);margin:16px 0 16px;text-transform:uppercase\">Six lines to<br>an autonomous agent</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:15px;max-width:440px\">No orchestration layer, no vector plumbing, no retry logic. Define the goal and the constraints — SYNAPSE handles planning, memory, verification and rollback.</p>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\">\n              <div><div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase\">Cold start</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--blue)\">0 ms</div></div>\n              <div><div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase\">SDKs</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--blue)\">4</div></div>\n              <div><div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase\">Regions</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--blue)\">19</div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#080703;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px 24px;overflow:auto\">\n            <div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px\">agent.ts — SYNAPSE CORE v4</div>\n<pre class=\"mono\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#c6baa8;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#d1ff5b\">import</span> { Mesh } <span style=\"color:#d1ff5b\">from</span> <span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"@synapse/core\"</span>;\n\n<span style=\"color:#d1ff5b\">const</span> agent = Mesh.spawn({\n  goal:    <span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"reconcile ledger &amp; flag drift\"</span>,\n  memory:  <span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"persistent\"</span>,\n  verify:  <span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"proof-carrying\"</span>,\n  policy:  [<span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"no-egress\"</span>, <span style=\"color:#ff1439\">\"pii-redact\"</span>],\n});\n\n<span style=\"color:#d1ff5b\">await</span> agent.run();\n<span style=\"color:#6b604d\">// ✓ 214 steps · 38ms p95 · trace signed</span></pre>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->\n  <section class=\"sec-pad\" id=\"pricing\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head rv\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">[ 04 — PRICING ]</div>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Pay for <span>thought</span>,<br>not for seats</h2>\n          <div class=\"rule\" style=\"width:220px\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <p>Metered by verified decision, not by token. Start free, scale to the mesh, or run the whole thing behind your own firewall.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"price-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"plan rv\">\n          <div class=\"pname\">Signal</div>\n          <div class=\"pprice\">$0</div>\n          <p class=\"pdesc\">For prototypes and weekend builds. No card, no expiry.</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>50k decisions / month</li>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>128k context window</li>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3\" stroke=\"#d1ff5b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>Community Discord</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#cta\">Start building</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"plan feat rv\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon\">MOST DEPLOYED</div>\n          <div class=\"pname\">Mesh</div>\n          <div class=\"pprice\">$480<sub>/mo</sub></div>\n          <p class=\"pdesc\">Production autonomy with proof-carrying traces and 19-region routing.</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>10M decisions / month</li>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3\" stroke=\"#ff1439\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>Full 2.4M context + memory</li>\n            <li><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M2 7l3.5 3.5